# Mistbreath Elder: with no other creature of its own to return (Bot2's Ornithopter does not count, CR 109.4) the Elder gets no counter
# ("if you do" fails) and Bot1 "may return this creature to its owner's hand" (CR 608.2d). At the turn 3 upkeep Bot1 declines: the
# Elder stays a 2/2. At the turn 5 upkeep it accepts and the Elder goes to Bot1's hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mistbreath Elder
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mistbreath Elder.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Decline
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mistbreath Elder.Power = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mistbreath Elder.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
[T5 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
[T5 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Mistbreath Elder.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
